    "title": "Attorney General-Elect 'Jay Jones' announces Inaugural Committee - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jenna Lejano No media credit provided. ,\n3 hours ago\nNORFOLK, Va. (WAVY) — On Nov. 10, the Attorney General-elect Jay Jones announced the formation of his Inaugural Committee. He over sees the events and community engagement.\nThe committee focused on creating celebrations that honor the Commonwealth’s diversity and reflected Jones’ commitments.\nThe Attorney General-elect has appointed the following members of his Inaugural Committee:\nDavid Mills, Chair (Consultant; Former Executive Director, Democratic Party of Virginia) Lashrecse Aird, Co-Chair (Delegate, District 10) Mark Herring, Co-Chair (Former Attorney General of Virginia) Mandy Burnett (Director of Government Affairs, Virginia Trail Lawyers Association) Tim Chapman (Managing Member, Chapman Development) Ben Dendy (President, Vectre Corporation) Bea Gonzale (Partner, Capital Results) Earl Granger (Chief Development and Impact Officer, Executive Leadership Council) David Jones (Founding Partner, Capitol Counsel) Anne Leigh Kerr (President, Kerry Government Strategies) Nancy Miller (Partner & CEO, The Miller Firm) Randy Toll (Executive Producer) Steve Toll (Managing Partner, Cohen Milstein) Daniel Watkins (Founding Partner, Meier Watkins) Derrick Walker (President, Virginia Trial Lawyers Association; Shareholder, Allen & Allen) Rachel Rothman (Inaugral Committee Direction) Ben Celestino (Inaugural Committee Finance Director)\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WAVY.com.\n9",
